      "short": "$x=-4$ or $x=\\frac12$.",
      "worked": "For $x<-1$:\n$$\\begin{align*}x+2&=-2\\\\x&=-4\\end{align*}$$\nThis satisfies $-4<-1$.\n\nFor $x\\ge -1$:\n$$\\begin{align*}-2x-1&=-2\\\\x&=\\frac12\\end{align*}$$\nThis satisfies $\\frac12\\ge -1$.\n\nTherefore, $x=-4$ or $x=\\frac12$.",
